# 🏠 Local Development Environment

This directory contains all components needed for local development and testing of the Job Analytics Platform.

## 🚀 Quick Start

1. Prerequisites:

```bash
make install-deps
```

2. Start all services:

```bash
make start
```

3. Run initial pipeline:

```bash
make run-pipeline
```

## 🔧 Components

- [📊 Data Directory](data/README.md)
- [🔄 Kestra Workflows](kestra/README.md)
- [📊 dbt Transformations](dbt/README.md)
- [📈 Metabase Dashboards](metabase/README.md)
- [🧪 Tests](tests/README.md)

## 📋 Make Commands

```bash
make start          # Start all containers
make stop           # Stop all containers
make test           # Run all tests
make lint           # Run linting
make clean          # Clean temporary files
make logs           # View logs
```

## 🔍 Component URLs

- Kestra UI: <http://localhost:8080>
- Metabase: <http://localhost:3000>
- MinIO (S3): <http://localhost:9001>

## 📊 Data Flow

1. Scrapers → Bronze Layer
2. dbt → Silver Layer
3. dbt → Gold Layer
4. Metabase Dashboards

## 🐞 Debugging

Set DEBUG=1 in .env for verbose logging.
